## Environment / secrets
# appsettings.json holds only safe local defaults and is committed. Real credentials
# (GitHub access token, webhook secret) belong in `dotnet user-secrets`, never in a
# tracked file — see docs/DEVELOPMENT.md.
.env
*.env.local
/App/Api/appsettings.Development.json
/App/Api/appsettings.*.local.json
